  "details": "Contact Receivers that send their transform matrix to a renderer, do not work locally in-game. They work correctly for remote players viewing your avatar, and they work in-engine. \n\nIn-game, for the local player, the contact receiver is sending the position with your avatar in a Tpose, at the world origin. The contacts themselves are in the correct position according to the overlay, but the matrix they send to the renderer is wrong.",
